Troubleshooting Tips
MinIO won't start:

Check if port 9000 or 9001 is already in use: netstat -tuln | grep 900
Kill existing process: pkill minio
Cannot connect with mc client:

Verify MinIO is running: ps aux | grep minio
Check alias configuration: mc alias list
Curl returns connection refused:

Ensure MinIO server is running
Verify correct port (9000 for API)
Files not uploading:

Check file paths exist: ls ~/sensitive-data/
Verify bucket exists: mc ls localminio/
